@startuml rf007_sequence
actor Actor
participant "Ingress" as Ingress
participant "Users Microservice" as Users
participant "SNS: UserEvents" as SNS
participant "Lambda: VerificationTrigger" as Lambda1
participant "TrueNative" as TN
participant "Lambda: NotificationService" as Lambda2
participant "AWS SES" as SES

Actor -> Ingress: POST /users (Create User)
Ingress -> Users: POST /users
Users -> Users: Create User (status: POR_VERIFICAR)
Users -> SNS: Publish USER_CREATED Event
Users -> Actor: 201 Created

SNS -> Lambda1: Trigger (USER_CREATED)
Lambda1 -> TN: POST /native/verify (transactionId, webhook)
TN -> Lambda1: 201 Accepted

note over TN: Background Verification (up to 120s)

TN -> Ingress: PATCH /users/verify/callback
Ingress -> Users: PATCH /users/verify/callback
Users -> Users: Validate verifyToken (SHA256)
Users -> Users: Update User Status (VERIFICADO/NO_VERIFICADO)
Users -> SNS: Publish VERIFICATION_COMPLETED Event
Users -> TN: 200 OK

SNS -> Lambda2: Trigger (VERIFICATION_COMPLETED)
Lambda2 -> SES: Send Email Notification
SES -> Actor: Email Inbox

@enduml
